title: "Code for: Sea ice-driven decline of abyssal ocean ventilation in an eddy-permitting coupled climate model"
abstract: "Code that computes water mass transformation budgets of Dense Shelf Water on the Antarctic Continental Shelf in the GFDL CM4X climate model and reproduces the analysis and figures in the accompanying paper."
